  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "If it activates, Finger Wind Dragon self-detonates into countless jade wind blades that shoot everywhere. The power is terrifying and has shown its might in the purple blood river formation. Feng Jiu Ge senses violent strength hiding inside Finger Wind Dragon and intuitively senses this follow-up.",
      "chapters": [
        1389
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
