        "move_finger_wind_dragon",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal killer move Finger Wind Dragon is named. Immortal killer move Chaotic Shooting Blades is named. Wu Yong flicks his fingers repeatedly, throwing out several dark jade worms. The worms grow into wind dragons that attack Heavenly Court’s defensive line. Wu Yong’s eyes flash with a green light. The wind dragons roar and turn into countless jade wind blades that shoot everywhere. The blades are sharp and cut everything in their path. Heavenly Court’s main force faces the killer moves forcibly. Wu Yong turns to infiltrate the defense line. Wan Zi Hong blocks him.",
